# Backend base URL, read at build time.
# Local dev: leave empty, Vite proxies /api to localhost:8000.
# Vercel: set VITE_API_URL in Project → Settings → Environment Variables to the
# Render backend URL, e.g. https://udyam-saathi-api.onrender.com, and set the
# backend's FRONTEND_ORIGIN to the Vercel URL so CORS allows it.
VITE_API_URL=
